 404:../Libraries/Infra/Ssw/TC4xx/Tricore/Ifx_Ssw_Infra.c ****         /* There is no need to check overflow of the STM timer.
 405:../Libraries/Infra/Ssw/TC4xx/Tricore/Ifx_Ssw_Infra.c ****          * When counter after overflow subtracted with counter before overflow,
 406:../Libraries/Infra/Ssw/TC4xx/Tricore/Ifx_Ssw_Infra.c ****          * the subtraction result will be as expected, as long as both are unsigned 32 bits
 407:../Libraries/Infra/Ssw/TC4xx/Tricore/Ifx_Ssw_Infra.c ****          * eg: stmCountBegin= 0xFFFFFFFE (before overflow)
 408:../Libraries/Infra/Ssw/TC4xx/Tricore/Ifx_Ssw_Infra.c ****          *     stmCountNow = 0x00000002 (before overflow)
 409:../Libraries/Infra/Ssw/TC4xx/Tricore/Ifx_Ssw_Infra.c ****          *     diff= stmCountNow - stmCountBegin = 4 as expected.*/
